#Customer Analytics and Business Frameworks

##Overview
This project demonstrates several widely used customer analytics frameworks for evaluating user behavior, retention, and revenue generation.
The analysis combines AARRR metrics, customer segmentation, cohort analysis, Lean Analytics indicators, and business visualizations using retail transaction data.

##Technologies
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn

##Project Workflow
- Data preprocessing
- Customer ID generation
- AARRR framework
- RFM segmentation
- Cohort analysis
- Retention heatmap
- Lean Analytics metrics
-Customer revenue analysis

##Business Frameworks
- AARRR
- RFM
- Cohort Analysis
- Lean Analytics

##Results
The project demonstrates how different analytical frameworks can be combined to evaluate customer acquisition, engagement, retention, and purchasing behavior.
Visualizations provide insights into customer segmentation, cohort retention, revenue distribution, and product category performance.
